   "options": "<h4>Letter Template Example</h4>\n\n<pre>Dear {{ recipient_name }}\nCompany: {{ company }}\n</pre>\n\n<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n\n<p>The field names you can use in your Letter Template are the fields in the Letter for which you are creating the template. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting the document type (e.g. Letter)</p>\n\n<h4>Templating</h4>\n\n<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
